    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85185" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυ-πήμων</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ονος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>causing manifold woe, baneful,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				h.Cer.
				230
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Merc.</u>
				37
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. νόσοι</span> diseases
