				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				2.287
			</span></i>: hence pr. n. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πολυπημονίδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, <i>son of Polypemon,</i> with a play on
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυπήμων,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				24.305
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
